-- Tests of the teachers' instruments of the second corona lockdown — the
-- circular תשפ"א/2 (l4/circulars/2020-21_tashpa_02.l4), which carries the
-- colleges' special agreement of 15.10.2020 for the year תשפ"א, and the
-- circular תש"פ/6 (l4/circulars/2019-20_tashaf_06.l4), whose agreement of
-- 31.3.2020 runs to the start of that year — held against the
-- public-sector agreement of 16.9.2020 (MMS-600). They sit beside the
-- circular and not in it (the client, 2026-10-22: "assertions about a file
-- should sit next to it, not be included in it").
--
-- The agreement of 16.9.2020 covers no teacher: it reaches an employee
-- represented by the New General Histadrut (its §2(א)), and the teaching
-- scale is represented by הסתדרות המורים, so §23 of the Collective
-- Agreements Law never weighs it against a teachers' agreement. Its
-- arrangement — no work, and a special payment of 70% of the components
-- counted for severance (§7) — has no counterpart for the teachers in the
-- corpus. For the colleges' lecturers, the two agreements the circulars
-- carry hand over at the start of the academic year תשפ"א at each college
-- (a day neither prints), so every day of 17.9.2020–11.10.2020 is under one
-- of them, and under both the salary is unchanged — the full consideration,
-- not 70% — with nothing charged to leave: the price is the duties put off
-- and made up, with nothing paid for them. Nothing is given less. For the
-- teachers in the schools the corpus holds no instrument for those weeks
-- (a sweep of the corpus for the lockdown, the agreement of 16.9.2020, the
-- "purple badge" and "עובד בהסדר" finds only the colleges' and the 2023
-- framework's grant), so nothing is held for them here.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `2020-09-16_framework-agreement_public-sector_covid-economic-arrangement`
IMPORT `2020-21_tashpa_02`
IMPORT `2019-20_tashaf_06`

§ `בדיקות חוזר תשפ"א/2 — מול ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 16.9.2020 (הסדרים לתקופה מוגבלת נוספת)`

§§ `מי שההסכם חל עליו`

-- No State teacher is in the agreement of 16.9.2020, by its §2 or by the
-- law. A lecturer of a college that joined is in the colleges' agreement of
-- 15.10.2020, and was in that of 31.3.2020.
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement of 16.9.2020 covers` `a teacher of the State in September 2020`
#ASSERT NOT `the collective agreement applies to the employee` `a special collective agreement` (`the 2020 arrangement employee, as the law asks` `a teacher of the State in September 2020`)
#ASSERT `the agreement applies to` `a lecturer at a college that acceded`
#ASSERT `the agreement covers` `a college lecturer in a joined college`

§§ `התקופה`

-- The round's period: 17.9.2020 to 11.10.2020, 25 days, unless the
-- restrictions were lifted earlier.
`the days of the 2020 arrangement period` MEANS
    DATE_SERIAL (`the 2020 arrangement period ends` NOTHING) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the 2020 arrangement period begins` PLUS 1

#ASSERT `the days of the 2020 arrangement period` EQUALS 25

-- The colleges' agreement of 31.3.2020 runs from 15.3.2020 to the start of
-- תשפ"א, and that of 15.10.2020 from that start: one or the other governs
-- every day of the round's period, whatever day the year starts.
#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL `the agreement period begins` LESS THAN DATE_SERIAL `the 2020 arrangement period begins`

§§ `התשלום`

-- A full-time employee of 10,000 in the arrangement for a whole month is
-- paid 7,000 (§7(א)); a lecturer with the same salary, nothing of it on
-- reporting, is paid it whole under either colleges' agreement — and the
-- difference is the 30% the arrangement takes. Neither charges his leave
-- (§7(ג) there; nothing here).
`a lecturer of 10,000 at a college that joined` MEANS
    `college teaching employee` WITH
        `employed at a teacher-training college`          IS TRUE
        `graded in the teaching-employees grading`        IS TRUE
        `salary under the teaching employees' agreements` IS TRUE
        `employed in the civil service`                   IS FALSE
        `the college signed the accession letter`         IS TRUE
        `salary for the work actually done`               IS 10000
        `reporting-dependent components`                  IS 0
        `share of the duties fulfilled`                   IS 1

`the round's month for an employee of 10,000` MEANS
    `the special payment of 16.9.2020` 10000 30 30 1

#ASSERT `the round's month for an employee of 10,000` EQUALS 7000
#ASSERT `consideration due` `a lecturer of 10,000 at a college that joined` FALSE EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the reduced consideration` 10000 0 EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `consideration due` `a lecturer of 10,000 at a college that joined` FALSE GREATER THAN `the round's month for an employee of 10,000`
#ASSERT NOT `the special period of 16.9.2020 is charged to the leave balance`

-- The lecturers' price: what is put off is made up in full, and nothing
-- more is paid for it (תשפ"א/2 §3, תש"פ/6 §4); the round's employee in
-- the arrangement owes no work for the special period.
#ASSERT `additional pay for deferred duties` TRUE TRUE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `extra pay for deferred duties` 2000 EQUALS 0
